{"4435880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sitarane's Legacy", "steam_appid": 4435880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into the shadows of the Tower, where only cunning and steel will ensure your survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sitarane's Legacy</strong> is an old-school, grid-based dungeon crawler that pays tribute to genre classics while introducing a ruthless modern competitive twist. Step into the boots of a daring adventurer and climb the floors of a mysterious tower packed with deadly traps, buried secrets, and legendary creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-School Exploration:</strong> Move tile-by-tile through labyrinthine dungeons where every turn could be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sitarane’s Challenge:</strong> Every day, a new procedurally generated dungeon becomes the <strong>Global Daily Seed</strong>. All players face the exact same tower: one shot, one leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Competition:</strong> Compare your progress against the world. Will you push further than your rivals to etch your name into legend?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Progression:</strong> Manage your resources, upgrade your skills, and survive increasingly sadistic floors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you prove worthy of Sitarane's legacy, or become just another shadow within the tower?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into the shadows of the Tower, where only cunning and steel will ensure your survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sitarane's Legacy</strong> is an old-school, grid-based dungeon crawler that pays tribute to genre classics while introducing a ruthless modern competitive twist. Step into th